f"The first scientific audit **PASSed** in {a['wall_seconds']:.2f} wall seconds: all {a['independent_grades']:,} independent grades and all {a['native_replays']:,} native responses replayed, plus {a['conventional_calls']:,} conventional-control evaluations. Panel, corpus, tasks, summary, journal chain and frozen artifacts were regenerated/verified. It uses the same native VM with an independent raster grader, not a second interpreter. Eight focused/related software tests passed before registration; no claim of a fresh full-suite run. No scientific repair or failed scientific audit occurred.",'',
f"All 294 registration hashes and all 358 prior M7 completion hashes verify. Original journal and SQLite-API backup have matching table contents and integrity checks. Total preserved M8 storage at backup was {p['storage_bytes']/2**30:.3f} GiB, with {p['disk_free_bytes']/2**30:.2f} GiB disk free, within 6/16 GiB bounds. All {p['whole_layouts']:,} cumulative layouts are exported, including {p['new_layouts']:,} new generated/rejected/unqueried layouts. Raw SQLite records remain local; compact evidence and reports are published. Future audits must write new packets.",'',
